6.3 Referential Integrity
Every source.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every assumption.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every limitation.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every revision.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every indicator_relation.indicator_id and indicator_relation.related_indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every work_link.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every verification_link.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every instrument_link.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every provenance.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

Every moderation.indicator_id must exist in economic_indicator.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The indicator relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

