12. Validation Engine Design
The system validates the following.

Validation 1. Indicator validity. Every indicator is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Work resolution.

Validation 5. Verification result resolution.

Validation 6. Instrument resolution.

Validation 7. Provenance completeness.

Validation 8. Audit completeness.

Validation 9. Moderation completeness.

Validation 10. Computation consistency. The computation method must be consistent with the source data.

Validation 11. Base year consistency. The base year must be consistent with the frequency.

Validation 12. Seasonal adjustment consistency. The seasonal adjustment method must be consistent with the frequency.

